{{DISPLAYTITLE:Arena of Valor Premier League 2026 - Playoffs}}
{{APL 2026 tabs}}{{HDB}}
==Format==
*'''Playoffs''' - ''July 4<sup>th</sup> - 19<sup>th</sup>''
** Double Elimination Bracket (except the one-off grand finals)
** Playoffs Round 1 matches are played in a {{Abbr/Bo5}}
** All other matches are played in a {{Abbr/Bo7}}
** All matches are played with Global Ban-Pick Rules
** '''From Playoffs Week 2 onwards''', the tournament will be played on the [https://lienquan.garena.vn/chi-tiet-ban-cap-nhat-ngay-hoi-lien-quan-08-07-2026/ July 8<sup>th</sup> Update (S3-2026 Patch).]
*** New hero {{heroIcon|Tamyn|size=16px|addTextLink=true}} is allowed to use.
*** Buffed: {{heroIcon|Omega|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}, {{heroIcon|Ignis|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}, {{heroIcon|Maloch|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}, {{heroIcon|Lindis|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}, {{heroIcon|Lu Bu|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}, {{heroIcon|TeeMee|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}, {{heroIcon|Zuka|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}, {{heroIcon|Valhein|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}
*** Nerfed: {{heroIcon|Flowborn (Marksman)|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}, {{heroIcon|Flowborn (Mage)|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}, {{heroIcon|Jinnar|size=16px|addTextLink=true}}
*** Hero {{heroIcon|Volkath|size=16px|addTextLink=true}} and {{heroIcon|Paine|size=16px|addTextLink=true}} are disabled.
*** Season-exclusive Gameplays: ''Spriteling Talents, Runic Power, Special Creeps'' removed.

