==Format==
*'''Swiss Stage''' - ''June 18<sup>th</sup> - 28<sup>th</sup>''
**16 teams will play 5 rounds of Swiss format:
***In each round, teams will play against a team with the same record.
***No regional protections are in place for the Swiss rounds.
****''This means no restriction on teams from the same league playing against each other.
****'''''GCS, AOG, RPL champions and runner-ups are guaranteed not to play against each other in Round 1.
*** Any matches that determines Elimination and/or Qualification are played in a {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
*** All other matches are played in a {{Abbr/Bo3}}.
**<span class="bg-up">Teams that reached 3 wins in swiss</span> advance to the Playoffs.
**<span class="bg-down">Teams that reached 3 loss in swiss</span> are eliminated.

