==Format==
*'''Group Stage''' - ''November 17<sup>th</sup> - 23<sup>th</sup>''
** 12 teams are split into 2 groups of 6 teams
*** 12 teams are split into 2 pots:
**** Pot 1 contains the three league champions from each of AOG, RPL, GCS;
**** Pot 2 contains the remaining 9 teams.
*** The three league champions will not be placed in the same group;
*** A maximum of 3 teams from the same region can be drawn into the same group.
** All matches are played in {{Abbr/Bo3}} with [[Global Banpick|Global Ban-Pick Rules]]
**<span class="bg-up">Top 4 of each group</span> advance to the Knockout Stage.

